### Login by phone + name (case / whitespace insensitive)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone": "067 707 40 27", "name": "олексій   куценко"}

### Who am I
GET http://localhost:8000/api/me

### SMS: request code (needs real provider; SMS_DEBUG=1 prints to stdout)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/login/sms/request
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone": "0977322904"}

### SMS: verify
POST http://localhost:8000/api/login/sms/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone": "0977322904", "code": "000000"}

### Classes
GET http://localhost:8000/api/classes

### Add classes
POST http://localhost:8000/api/classes
Content-Type: application/json

[{"name": "5-А"}, {"name": "7-Б"}]

### Upsert attendance
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/attendance/2026-09-08/5-А
Content-Type: application/json

{"registered": 25, "abroad": 1, "illness_count": 2, "illness_names": "Іваненко Іван, Петренко Петро"}

### Attendance for a date
GET http://localhost:8000/api/attendance?date=2026-09-08

### Attendance for a month
GET http://localhost:8000/api/attendance?month=2026-09

### Send meal summary to Telegram
POST http://localhost:8000/api/attendance/summary?date=2026-09-08

### Logout
POST http://localhost:8000/api/logout
